      "id": "claim_02abc35325b748e5877f5451c2ae4ab6",
      "statement": "The export system uses field-level dirty tracking: each modified row is coalesced into one entry per row in psChanges/rsChanges, carrying the changed fields and the before-state for conflict detection. New rows are queued as full-row appends with _row_num=null until export assigns a row number.",
